            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003E\u0027Sarah Philips\u0027 is changed to \u0027Sarah Smith\u0027 by code in \u003Cem\u003ESummaryCardController\u003C/em\u003E. This shows how you might insert data from a database when using a summary card for the \u003Ca href=\u0022https://design-system.service.gov.uk/patterns/check-answers/\u0022\u003ECheck answers\u003C/a\u003E pattern.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
